Yes bro. Now we are at exactly the right point. I can see your existing **SheetLock Bot → Switch → Case: HO** flow.

Since your Excel side is already working, we will make `/HO` simply **read the `HO_Automation` table and display the current HO in a beautiful Adaptive Card**.

### Our flow will be

```text
Get message details
        ↓
Html to text
        ↓
Full message
        ↓
Command
        ↓
Switch
        ↓
Case: HO
        ↓
List rows present in HO_Automation
        ↓
Prepare each HO section
        ↓
Adaptive Card
        ↓
Post card to Teams
```

