Then same pattern:

| Section               | Compose                      |
| --------------------- | ---------------------------- |
| Problems              | `ProblemsDetails`            |
| CTASKS                | `CTASKDetails`               |
| GTSOPS Tickets        | `GTSOPSDetails`              |
| Critical Malcodes     | `CriticalMalcodesDetails`    |
| Non Critical Malcodes | `NonCriticalMalcodesDetails` |
| Group 1               | `Group1Details`              |
| Group 2               | `Group2Details`              |
| Group 3               | `Group3Details`              |
| Group 4               | `Group4Details`              |
| Group 5               | `Group5Details`              |
| Ingestion             | `IngestionDetails`           |
| ETL                   | `ETLDetails`                 |
| Synapse               | `SynapseDetails`             |
| Other                 | `OtherDetails`               |

So essentially:

```text
List rows
   ↓
Filter Reporting Date → Compose ReportingDate
   ↓
Filter Show Stopper → Compose ShowStopperDetails
   ↓
Filter PRB → Compose PRBDetails
   ↓
Filter RITM → Compose RITMDetails
   ↓
...
```

**Important:** We are NOT splitting the Details cell.

If RITM contains 10 lines in one Excel cell, we take that **entire cell** and display it as one section.

